      "text": "```\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|              PEPPER & SALT: PARALLEL HISTORIES                   |\n|                                                                  |\n|  BLACK PEPPER (Piper nigrum)        SALT (NaCl)                  |\n|  .--------------------------.       .------------------------.   |\n|  | Flavor + mild heat       |       | Preservation + taste   |   |\n|  | Malabar Coast -> World    |       | Geology + sea -> World  | |\n|  | Venetian monopoly        |       | Gabelle, Via Salaria   |   |\n|  | Price: 60x origin        |       | Price: taxation tool   |   |\n|  | Drove Age of Exploration |       | Drove political history|   |\n|  .--------------------------.       .------------------------.   |\n|                                                                  |\n|  SHARED ROLE: The two substances that humans have traded         |\n|  across every continent for at least 3,000 years.                |\n|  One from a tropical vine. One from geology.                     |\n+------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
