        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nPIPER NIGRUM LIFECYCLE\n+-------------------------------------------------------+\n|                                                       |\n|  Climbing woody vine (liana)                          |\n|  Requires support tree (areca palm traditional)       |\n|  Grows best: 10-20 deg N/S latitude                   |\n|  Requires: 125-200cm annual rainfall                  |\n|  Kerala (Malabar Coast), SW India = origin            |\n|                                                       |\n|  FRUIT STAGES -> PRODUCT                              |\n|  .----------.  .----------.  .----------.             |\n|  | Unripe   |  | Ripe red |  | Dried    |             |\n|  | green    |  | drupe    |  | states   |             |\n|  | drupe    |  |          |  |          |             |\n|  .----------.  .----------.  .----------.             |\n|  |       |              |            |                |\n|  |       v              v            v                |\n|  .--------.    .--------.   .----------.              |\n|  | GREEN  |    | RED    |   | BLACK:   |              |\n|  | pepper |    | pepper |   | unripe,  |              |\n|  | (brine |    | (rare, |   | dried/   |              |\n|  | or FD) |    | fresh) |   | wrinkled |              |\n|  .--------.    .--------.   .----------.              |\n|                              .----------.             |\n|                              | WHITE:   |             |\n|                              | ripe,    |             |\n|                              | hull     |             |\n|                              | removed  |             |\n|                              .----------.             |\n+-------------------------------------------------------+"
    },
