      "text": "MECHANISM:\n  Piperine ≠ capsaicin mechanism\n  - Activates TRPA1 + TRPV1 (at higher concentrations)\n  - Inhibits CYP3A4 and P-glycoprotein (drug-metabolizing enzymes)\n  -> Piperine increases bioavailability of many drugs/compounds"
