      "text": "Most famous interaction:\n  PIPERINE + CURCUMIN -> 20x bioavailability increase for curcumin\n  (via CYP450 inhibition - slows first-pass metabolism)\n  This is why traditional Indian cooking combines black pepper + turmeric\n  - discovered empirically thousands of years before the biochemistry"
