      "text": "## The Venice Monopoly and Why It Drove Exploration"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-PEPPER-SALT.md#020",
      "path": [
        "01-PEPPER-SALT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:spices:01-pepper-salt, git-history:spices:01-pepper-salt]",
