        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Pepper and Salt - The Two Universal Spices",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nPRICE CHAIN (c. 1450):\n  Kerala farmgate price: ~2 denarii/lb\n  Arab dhow trader markup\n  Red Sea/Persian Gulf transit\n  Cairo/Alexandria wholesale\n  Venetian import price: ~30-40x farmgate\n  Venice -> North European cities: 60x farmgate"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-PEPPER-SALT.md#021",
      "path": [
        "01-PEPPER-SALT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:spices:01-pepper-salt, git-history:spices:01-pepper-salt]",
        "canonical_path": "spices/01-PEPPER-SALT.md",
