        "section": "spices",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Pepper and Salt - The Two Universal Spices",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Driving the Portuguese response:\n  King João II of Portugal -> fund Cape exploration\n  Rationale: ELIMINATE the Venice/Arab markup entirely\n  Vasco da Gama (1498): direct route, no middlemen\n  Result: Portuguese disrupted the most lucrative\n  trade monopoly in European history\n```"
    },
